  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<div><div><p><span><span>Boost your SQL queries with powerful</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>regular expressions (</span><span>r</span><span>egex</span><span>)</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>support for advanced pattern matching.</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>Now you can</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>use native</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>r</span><span>egex in T-SQL</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>directly in</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>Azure SQL</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>and SQL Server 2025</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>queries</span><span>—simplifying code, improving maintainability, and reducing dependency on external scripts.</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span></span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/sql-regex-ga\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><br></div>",
    "Markdown": "Boost your SQL queries with powerful regular expressions ( r egex ) support for advanced pattern matching. Now you can use native r egex in T-SQL directly in Azure SQL and SQL Server 2025 queries —simplifying code, improving maintainability, and reducing dependency on external scripts.\n\nLearn more"
  },
